    "steam_appid": 3716670,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716670/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.poster.avif?t=1748873186\" width=600 height=82 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716670/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.webm?t=1748873186\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716670/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.mp4?t=1748873186\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> Thief Simulator: Robin Hood</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The main character of the game is a professional thief.</strong> <br>During one of his heists, he was betrayed and ended up in police custody. To avoid spending many years behind bars, the police offered him a deal: <br>Under the code name <i>Robin Hood</i>, the thief must rob various criminals who are untouchable by law due to lack of evidence or the inability to obtain search warrants.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your mission is to steal valuable items, evidence, and documents that will help put these criminals behind bars for many years.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >In the game, you\u2019ll experience:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various locations and missions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lots of puzzles and mysteries</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diverse criminals, each with their own secrets and paranoia</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engaging stealth gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A range of enemies: criminals, insane homeowners, guard dogs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re working undercover, so to the police, you\u2019re just a regular thief</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And much more...</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716670/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.poster.avif?t=1748873186\" width=600 height=82 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716670/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.webm?t=1748873186\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716670/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.mp4?t=1748873186\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> Thief Simulator: Robin Hood</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The main character of the game is a professional thief.</strong> <br>During one of his heists, he was betrayed and ended up in police custody. To avoid spending many years behind bars, the police offered him a deal: <br>Under the code name <i>Robin Hood</i>, the thief must rob various criminals who are untouchable by law due to lack of evidence or the inability to obtain search warrants.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your mission is to steal valuable items, evidence, and documents that will help put these criminals behind bars for many years.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >In the game, you\u2019ll experience:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various locations and missions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lots of puzzles and mysteries</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diverse criminals, each with their own secrets and paranoia</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engaging stealth gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A range of enemies: criminals, insane homeowners, guard dogs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re working undercover, so to the police, you\u2019re just a regular thief</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And much more...</p></li></ul>",
